# Backend Microservices Rules

## Objective
Make the backend horizontally extensible, independently deployable, and maintainable.

## Required architecture

- API Gateway
- independent domain services
- explicit service boundaries
- contract-driven communication
- centralized auth and policy enforcement

## Service domains

- auth-service
- user-service
- companion-service
- order-service
- review-service
- finance-service
- admin-service

## Service rules

- services must not directly depend on each other's internals
- communicate through API contracts or shared DTOs only
- avoid circular dependencies
- keep service responsibilities narrow

## Migration rule

Any feature addition must first identify the correct service boundary.
